{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46243","headline":"送薛侍郎贬峡州司马 · 贯休","name":"送薛侍郎贬峡州司马","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"得罪唯惊恩未酬，夷陵山谁称闲游。\n人知八凯须当国，猨到三声不用愁。\n花落扁舟香冉冉，草侵公署雨修修。\n因人好寄新诗好，不独江东有沃州。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46243.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46243","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}